    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE JUNGLE CALLS... DO YOU ANSWER?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.poster.avif?t=1754913454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.webm?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.mp4?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fluid momentum based movement system. Live the fantasy of ape-ing out at maximum speed, with no movement speed limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a wide variety of movement mechanics and parkour moves: Dash, Slide, Dive, Slam or combine them all with the Monkey developed Banan-Bomb technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with fellow apes, top the scoreboards and become the alpha primate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.poster.avif?t=1754913454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.webm?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.mp4?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operate an epic fecal-fueled arsenal of primal weapons to deliver dopamine straight to your primate dome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blitz your way through destructible environments and lay waste to Tiki Cults, Cybernetic Armies and Ancient Beings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your Ape with black market serums and rare artifacts, to create your very own monkey build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.poster.avif?t=1754913454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.webm?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.mp4?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a Chimp crusade to far away lands, including Lush Jungles, Ancient Temples, Neon Cityscapes and bonus Hidden Realms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make friends with the locals, relax on Ape Island and catch some fish for a nice Monkey supper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to a diverse soundtrack, with synth-wave, bongo beats, rock and more.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>  </i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE JUNGLE CALLS... DO YOU ANSWER?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.poster.avif?t=1754913454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.webm?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.mp4?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fluid momentum based movement system. Live the fantasy of ape-ing out at maximum speed, with no movement speed limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a wide variety of movement mechanics and parkour moves: Dash, Slide, Dive, Slam or combine them all with the Monkey developed Banan-Bomb technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with fellow apes, top the scoreboards and become the alpha primate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.poster.avif?t=1754913454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.webm?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.mp4?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operate an epic fecal-fueled arsenal of primal weapons to deliver dopamine straight to your primate dome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blitz your way through destructible environments and lay waste to Tiki Cults, Cybernetic Armies and Ancient Beings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your Ape with black market serums and rare artifacts, to create your very own monkey build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.poster.avif?t=1754913454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.webm?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.mp4?t=1754913454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a Chimp crusade to far away lands, including Lush Jungles, Ancient Temples, Neon Cityscapes and bonus Hidden Realms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make friends with the locals, relax on Ape Island and catch some fish for a nice Monkey supper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to a diverse soundtrack, with synth-wave, bongo beats, rock and more.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>  </i></p>",
    "short_description": "Unleash chaos as a bio-engineered ape in this hyper-fast FPS. Dash, grapple, and blast through deadly obstacle courses and arenas using a massive arsenal of over-the-top weapons. Master momentum, dodge death, and dominate the leaderboards to become the Alpha Primate.",
